'''Dragonair''' (Japanese: '''ハクリュー''' ''Hakuryu'') is a {{ct|Dragon}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

