==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 10 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Alcremie Drop Event]], which ran from July 2 to 12, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Dragonair|130}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion.
*{{a|Shed Skin}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Dragonair}} can have.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

